[For "black"]
[Kind "sideline"]
[Start "caro-advance 4...e6"]
[Name "Advance: 5.Nc3"]

5. Nc3 { Develops, but the knight takes c3 from the pawn, so d4 will have no pawn to lean on. }
5... c5 { Strikes at once, for that reason. }
6. Bb5+ Nc6 { Blocks and develops. }
7. O-O Bg4 { The bishop goes to work on the knight that guards d4 and e5. [%cal Gg4f3] } *
